{% liquid
  assign s = section.settings
%}

<div class="section-background color-{{ s.color_scheme }}"></div>
<section class="nani-story color-{{ s.color_scheme }}"
  style="--pbs: {{ s.padding-block-start }}px; --pbe: {{ s.padding-block-end }}px;"
>
  <div class="nani-story__inner">
    <header class="nani-story__head">
      {% if s.eyebrow != blank %}
        <div class="nani-story__eyebrow">{{ s.eyebrow }}</div>
      {% endif %}
      {% if s.headline != blank %}
        <h2 class="nani-story__title">{{ s.headline }}</h2>
      {% endif %}
    </header>

    <div class="nani-story__copy">
      {% if s.body_before != blank %}{{ s.body_before }}{% endif %}

      {% if s.pullquote != blank %}
        <blockquote class="nani-story__pullquote">{{ s.pullquote }}</blockquote>
      {% endif %}

      {% if s.body_after != blank %}{{ s.body_after }}{% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% stylesheet %}
  .nani-story {
    position: relative;
  }
  .nani-story__inner {
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: var(--pbs) 40px var(--pbe) 40px;
  }
  .nani-story__head {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 56px;
  }
  .nani-story__eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-body--family);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.22em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    margin-bottom: 14px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .nani-story__title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading--family);
    font-size: clamp(44px, 5vw, 60px);
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1;
    margin: 0;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--color-foreground-heading);
  }
  .nani-story__title em { font-style: italic; color: var(--color-primary); }

  .nani-story__copy {
    font-family: var(--font-body--family);
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--color-foreground);
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .nani-story__copy p { margin: 0 0 22px; }
  .nani-story__copy > p:first-of-type::first-letter {
    font-family: var(--font-heading--family);
    font-size: 72px;
    float: left;
    line-height: 0.85;
    margin: 6px 10px 0 0;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .nani-story__pullquote {
    font-family: var(--font-heading--family);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: clamp(28px, 3vw, 36px);
    line-height: 1.25;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    text-align: center;
    margin: 56px 0;
    padding: 40px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid rgb(var(--color-foreground-rgb) / 0.08);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(var(--color-foreground-rgb) / 0.08);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
  .nani-story__pullquote::before {
    content: "\201C";
    display: block;
    font-size: 60px;
    color: #C9A227;
    line-height: 0;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .nani-story__inner { padding-left: 24px; padding-right: 24px; }
    .nani-story__copy { font-size: 16px; }
  }
{% endstylesheet %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Story longform",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "section",
  "enabled_on": {
    "templates": ["page", "index"]
  },
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "eyebrow",
      "label": "Eyebrow",
      "default": "How we started"
    },
    {
      "type": "inline_richtext",
      "id": "headline",
      "label": "Headline",
      "default": "From the <em>bedroom</em> to your doorstep."
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "body_before",
      "label": "Body (before pullquote)",
      "default": "<p>In 2021, Redkisses started as a handful of custom bracelets made for friends around Akron — beading them at the kitchen table between shifts, posting what was made on Instagram. Requests kept coming, so the table became a workspace and the workspace became a business.</p><p>The next year, a signature lip gloss joined the lineup and sold out twice in its first month. Shades and matching sets followed. Redkisses is still run out of Akron, still hand-packed one order at a time, still obsessed with getting the little things right.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pullquote",
      "label": "Pullquote",
      "default": "Honest pricing isn't a slogan. It's the whole reason the business exists."
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "body_after",
      "label": "Body (after pullquote)",
      "default": "<p>Today Redkisses stocks lip gloss, jewelry, anklets, shades and matching sets — every piece checked before it gets listed. Every order is hand-packed in a gift-ready box. Every DM gets a real reply. That's the whole model.</p><p>We're not trying to be a department store. We're trying to be the go-to for the everyday woman and girl who wants to shine without overspending. That's enough.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Appearance"
    },
    {
      "type": "color_scheme",
      "id": "color_scheme",
      "label": "Color scheme",
      "default": "scheme-1"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding-block-start",
      "label": "Top padding",
      "min": 40,
      "max": 200,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 96
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding-block-end",
      "label": "Bottom padding",
      "min": 40,
      "max": 200,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 96
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Story",
      "category": "Redkisses"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
